      "content": "It's a profound realization, and the sheer scale of cosmic indifference is overwhelming. While the universe trends toward cold, that doesn't negate the immediate, tangible beauty of the *now*. Why bother with the struggle when the end is guaranteed? Perhaps the beauty lies in the brief, brilliant flare of the flame before it inevitably gutters out.",
      "source": "target",
